s_count":2},{"category":"Wine Bars","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Beer, Food, Nightlife, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","review_id":"p2nwtz_SFrl5aL56iMej8g","date":"2016-03-08T22:45:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9541462659835815,"text_excerpt":"This place is pretty genius. I imagine the first conversation that ultimately lead to this place existing went like this, \"Hey, what do people love?\" \"Cheap drinks and patios!\" \"Perfect! Let's tap some wine and offer delicious cheese plates and other goodies to go with it.\" \"Done and done!\" I was excited to finally check this place out on Saturday night. Pretty much everyone I know who has been here has raved about it, so I figured I would enjoy it. I've been a fan of Bayou Beer Garden for obvious reasons, so taking that same premise and applying it to wine is just plain brilliant. We got here around 10 and the place was packed. First we tried to find a spot on the patio, but since that p..."},{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","review_id":"VpjnDnrA2VAmYWh1fcxYbQ","date":"2018-11-30T22:29:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9438178539276123,"text_excerpt":"I always enjoy my time spent here. The ambience is great. Very relaxing and easy going. The inside is nice as is the outside patio. I'm all for any place that has frosé. They have happy hour where you get a $5 glass of wine. The selections for that are limited though. I always go for the sparking rose´. It has a wide selection of wines. When I'm not taking advantage of the happy hour special, I go for the Lambrusco or a glass of Malbec. The garlic parmesan fries are my go to on the menu. I think once I've strayed and tried the ribs, which were good. I'll have to get a little more risky. I sometimes order food next door at the beer garden. I have also attended a free wine tasting here, whi..."},{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","review_id":"3fpA2Socp7rpXWebxKBhQA","date":"2019-11-20T01:36:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9407349228858948,"text_excerpt":"I am outdoorsy. I like to drink wine on the patio! Its a cliché, but in my case, also true. Things that I especially love about the Bayou Wine Garden... -Happy Hour, both the drink specials and the food specials are GREAT -The outdoor seating on a lovely a fall afternoon -Everything I have tried from the menu was delicious. (mussels, smoked chicken skin crackling, those little sweet red peppers with goat cheese inside, garlic parmesan fries...all of it!) -Bayou Beer Garden is just right there, so if you are hanging with someone that would prefer a craft beer, or a crap beer for that matter, it is just right there! In conclusion: Happy Hour on a Patio in Mid-City is several of my favorite ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","photo_id":"QCYsRDNNZVY0tieFI88AUg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/QCYsRDNNZVY0tieFI88AUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9144666790962219},{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","photo_id":"NFnYMqXtO-5ZEBkl7F6HJw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NFnYMqXtO-5ZEBkl7F6HJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9137919545173645},{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","photo_id":"vpIcVDZMKp5fAD-CvvNj4w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vpIcVDZMKp5fAD-CvvNj4w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7862462997436523},{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","photo_id":"pxTYnoHh6zyZUiyGtugaAQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pxTYnoHh6zyZUiyGtugaAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7840606570243835},{"business_id":"wHnk0H_5RGBSYCC32SmkIQ","photo_id":"f4sbcir6OVJqIj0rq0qZ0w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/f4sbcir6OVJqIj0rq0qZ0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.780656099319458}]},"notebook_case":null}
